  "title": "Spicy Smoked Turkey and Black Bean Soup",
  "description": "Spice up a turkey-vegetable soup with tomatoes, lemon juice, and jalapenos and enjoy a zesty meal. It&#39;s a great way to use up leftover turkey.",
